{"data":{"body":"**P2:** This can select success after a continuation failure has already won under `activeThreads` but before `signalContinuationFailure()` publishes it to `executionExceptionFuture`. The invocation may return `SUCCEEDED`; an oversized result can also skip its mandatory checkpoint. Atomically arbitrate closure against `selectedContinuationFailure` under this lock, propagate the selected retry failure before serialization, and test the selection-to-publication interleaving with a large output.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-Husk","finding_digest":"eec259eaa6e55371ed3dd836b70177d6400c09efa88c99a28a4e59f0bd3c3039","finding_id":"arf_v1_53bft2vg4vjxd3j53a3loalx2z","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::runcheckpointcontinuation::invocation-teardown-escape","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::runcheckpointcontinuation::invocation-teardown-escape","line":742,"observation_digest":"8c9f233e142ac6919d4a185668927307027a94b7b43d9b0413b989872c46b35b","observation_id":"aro_v1_rspsgpqufldjdhkkdblgretta4","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_53bft2vg4vjxd3j53a3loalx2z","published_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gja2hfbjnzxta557cdhm3nh4u4","reviewed_base_sha":"1064d0ec32e5b1650b4fa08e65ca960361c7cd1b","reviewed_head_sha":"f256f4f0a303ef8babf5676a2684f94f3686ec33","reviewer":"codex","start_line":742,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_lvti62ci47ocivxwz5xw42d5o7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
